<html lang='en'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <title>New Device Login - PePP Cruise</title>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f8fafc;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 20px;
      }
      .container {
        background-color: #ffffff;
        margin: 50px auto;
        padding: 30px;
        max-width: 600px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(95, 61, 244, 0.1);
      }
      .header {
        text-align: center;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e53e3e, #c53030);
        color: #ffffff;
        padding: 25px 0;
        border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;
        margin: -30px -30px 30px -30px;
      }
      .header h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 26px;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      .brand-name {
        font-size: 18px;
        margin-bottom: 5px;
        opacity: 0.9;
      }
      .content {
        padding: 0 10px;
      }
      .content p {
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #4a5568;
        margin: 15px 0;
      }
      .greeting {
        font-size: 18px;
        color: #1a202c;
        font-weight: 500;
      }
      .otp-container {
        background-color: #f7fafc;
        border: 2px solid #5f3df4;
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 25px;
        text-align: center;
        margin: 25px 0;
      }
      .otp-code {
        font-size: 36px;
        font-weight: bold;
        letter-spacing: 8px;
        color: #2A239F;
        margin: 15px 0;
      }
      .security-warning {
        background-color: #fee;
        border-left: 4px solid #e53e3e;
        padding: 15px 20px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        margin: 20px 0;
      }
      .security-warning p {
        margin: 5px 0;
        color: #742a2a;
      }
      .info-box {
        background-color: #f0f9ff;
        border-left: 4px solid #10b981;
        padding: 15px 20px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        margin: 20px 0;
      }
      .info-box p {
        margin: 5px 0;
        color: #065f46;
      }
      .footer {
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #718096;
        margin-top: 30px;
        padding-top: 20px;
        border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      }
      .footer .signature {
        color: #5f3df4;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class='container'>
      <div class='header'>
        <div class='brand-name'>PePP Cruise</div>
        <h1>⚠️ New Device Detected</h1>
      </div>

      <div class='content'>
        <p class='greeting'>Hello there,</p>

        <p>
          We detected a login attempt from a new device on your PePP Cruise account.
        </p>

        <div class='security-warning'>
          <p><strong>🔒 Security Alert:</strong></p>
          <p>For your account security, please verify this login attempt by entering the OTP code below.</p>
        </div>

        <div class='otp-container'>
          <p style='margin-bottom: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #5F3DF4;'>Verification Code</p>
          <p class='otp-code'>{{otpCode}}</p>
          <p style='margin: 10px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #718096;'>
            Use this code to complete your login
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class='info-box'>
          <p><strong>⏰ Important:</strong></p>
          <p>This verification code is valid for 5 minutes only.</p>
          <p><strong>🔒 Security:</strong> Never share this code with anyone. PePP Cruise staff will never ask for this code.</p>
        </div>

        <p>
          If you did not attempt to login from a new device, please:
        </p>
        <ul style='padding-left: 20px;'>
          <li>Do not enter the code</li>
          <li>Change your password immediately</li>
          <li>Contact our support team at
            <a href='mailto:support@peppcruise.com' style='color: #5F3DF4; text-decoration: none;'>
              support@peppcruise.com
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class='footer'>
        <p>Best regards,</p>
        <p class='signature'>The PePP Cruise Security Team</p>
        <p style='margin-top: 15px; font-size: 12px;'>
          © 2024 PePP Cruise. All rights reserved.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>


